      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Smart three-year-old PALLADIUM NZ (8) makes his first appearance since his fighting win in the Queensland Derby in July. Draws wide but has been readied for his return with a trial win. Has plenty of upside and this looks highly winnable. BUZZ BOMB (9) draws wider than in last week's solid effort but he did well to finish fifth from this barrier in the August Gift Final prior and was a winner here last month. MICK DANGER (5) has been ticking along okay, clocking in third from this barrier here last time for his third placing in his last five starts. Worth including along with JILLIBY FABIO (10) who draws wide but has been coming from the back row in higher-graded races of late and placed the last time he raced here.",
